From d6bed84b5d842e8378600691ec489f369b56196f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 20:10:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Image formats: the translators, from packages built in
 prose-packages

The image shipped no translators at all until the packaging fix, and then
only PNG. It now carries the full set this build can produce:

  no external dependency - BMP, GIF, HVIF, ICO, PCX, PPM, PSD, RTF, SGI,
  STXT, TGA. These needed nothing but listing; they were simply absent.

  from local packages - JPEG (libjpeg_turbo), PNG (libpng16), TIFF (tiff),
  WebP (libwebp). Verified to link: libjpeg.so.62, libtiff.so.6,
  libwebp.so.7. giflib rides along because libwebp requires lib:libgif.

The libraries are installed into the image through UserBuildConfig so the
translators can load at runtime.

Not available: AVIF needs libavif1.0_devel, JPEG2000 needs jasper, ICNS
needs libicns_devel and RAW needs libraw - none built yet. Audio and video
decoding is a bigger gap: Haiku decodes media through its ffmpeg plugin,
so the audio and video codec libraries that exist in prose-packages
(vorbis, opus, flac, speex, mpg123, lame, theora, vpx, dav1d, wavpack)
cannot be used by the media kit on their own; they are dependencies for
building ffmpeg, which is the package that would actually give playback.

Note: the JPEG translator's catalog (translation string) pass fails on a
missing jpeglib.h because that pass does not get build-feature headers.
The translator itself builds and links; only its localisations are absent.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 build/jam/UserBuildConfig               |  2 +-
 build/jam/images/definitions/minimum    | 21 ++++++++++++++++++---
 build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 |  8 ++++++++
 3 files changed, 27 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/build/jam/UserBuildConfig b/build/jam/UserBuildConfig
index b41a619728..a634cdbc2d 100644
--- a/build/jam/UserBuildConfig
+++ b/build/jam/UserBuildConfig
@@ -2,4 +2,4 @@
 # libpng16 provides the runtime library for PNGTranslator, which Tracker needs
 # to decode the desktop wallpaper. The package is built in prose-packages and
 # resolved locally (HAIKU_NO_DOWNLOADS=1, see private_workspace/README.md).
-AddHaikuImageSystemPackages libpng16 ;
+AddHaikuImageSystemPackages libpng16 libjpeg_turbo tiff libwebp giflib ;
diff --git a/build/jam/images/definitions/minimum b/build/jam/images/definitions/minimum
index 0ff4abcdc5..345175f0f8 100644
--- a/build/jam/images/definitions/minimum
+++ b/build/jam/images/definitions/minimum
@@ -281,10 +281,25 @@ SYSTEM_ADD_ONS_ACCELERANTS = [ FFilterByBuildFeatures
 	}@ # riscv64
 ] ;
 
-SYSTEM_ADD_ONS_TRANSLATORS =
-	PNGTranslator@libpng
+SYSTEM_ADD_ONS_TRANSLATORS = [ FFilterByBuildFeatures
+	# no external dependency
+	BMPTranslator
+	GIFTranslator
+	HVIFTranslator
+	ICOTranslator
+	PCXTranslator
+	PPMTranslator
+	PSDTranslator
+	RTFTranslator
+	SGITranslator
 	STXTTranslator
-;
+	TGATranslator
+	# from packages built in prose-packages
+	JPEGTranslator@jpeg
+	PNGTranslator@libpng
+	TIFFTranslator@tiff
+	WebPTranslator@libwebp
+] ;
 
 SYSTEM_ADD_ONS_LOCALE_CATALOGS =
 	<catalog-addon>plaintext
diff --git a/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64 b/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
index ffd377c1f9..00987c9ad3 100644
--- a/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
+++ b/build/jam/repositories/HaikuPorts/arm64
@@ -40,6 +40,14 @@ RemotePackageRepository HaikuPorts
 	sed-4.9_bootstrap-1
 	texinfo-7.2_bootstrap-1
 	libpng16-1.6.53-1
+	libjpeg_turbo-3.1.4.1-1
+	libjpeg_turbo_devel-3.1.4.1-1
+	tiff-4.7.0-1
+	tiff_devel-4.7.0-1
+	libwebp-1.6.0-3
+	libwebp_devel-1.6.0-3
+	giflib-5.2.2-1
+	giflib_devel-5.2.2-1
 	libpng16_devel-1.6.53-1
 	zlib-1.2.13_bootstrap-1
 	zlib_devel-1.2.13_bootstrap-1
-- 
